    <DataNode elementId="AT5G43860-MONOMER" textLabel="Chlorophyllase-2, chloroplastic" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q9M7I7" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="450" centerY="415" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana CLH2&lt;/i&gt; gene was expressed in &lt;i&gt;E. coli&lt;/i&gt; and shown to encode a protein with chlorophyllase activity. This enzyme catalyzes the hydrolysis of the ester bond of both chlorophyll &lt;i&gt;a&lt;/i&gt;, producing chlorophyllide &lt;i&gt;a&lt;/i&gt; and phytol |CITS:[10611389]|. Unlike its homologue |FRAME:AT1G19670|, expression of &lt;i&gt;CLH2&lt;/i&gt; is not regulated by jasmonate |CITS:[10611389]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT5G43860-MONOMER" />
